{"page":20036,"part":1,"text":"论书启\n\n\n逸少自吴兴以前，诸书犹为未称。凡厥好迹，皆是向在会稽时、永和十许年中者。从失郡告灵不仕以后，略不复自书，皆使比一人，世中不能别也。见其缓异，呼为末年书。逸少亡后，子敬年十七、八，全仿此人书，故遂成与之相似，今圣旨标题，足使众识顿悟。于逸少，无复末年之讥。阮研，近闻有一人学研书，遂不复可别。臣比廓摹所得，虽粗写字形，而无复其用笔迹势。不审前后诸卷一两条谨密者，可得在出装之例，复蒙垂给至年末间不？此泽自天，直以启审，非敢必觊。\n\n【空白页】","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20036,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"14776333aad8f112151fd0bcaa257cb99d6d66a38f6268ec42b10c1e196bf085","textSha256":"14776333aad8f112151fd0bcaa257cb99d6d66a38f6268ec42b10c1e196bf085","fileSha256":"14776333aad8f112151fd0bcaa257cb99d6d66a38f6268ec42b10c1e196bf085","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20036-work-037.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"论书启 · 论书启","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/5t66fy6BsmoTGVgjB5gddu","originalPages":[83,84],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":4,"sourceTextSha256":"40ab28fafd70d7dad1315fabcda94cc2aae7ce8325befe3efced4c41d2ee1b0a","id":"local-83-0-10","page_id":83,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":10,"reviewedTextSha256":"1683cedbeaf0852ba86a024b9932fd76bd89902eb062d29c3ac0793448c66ef0","displayUnitOrigins":[[6,7],[7,8],[8,9],[9,10]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":83,"part":1,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"肖源","verifiedAt":"2026-10-20T14:09:58.977Z","revision":"1683cedbeaf0852ba86a024b9932fd76bd89902eb062d29c3ac0793448c66ef0","textSha256":"1683cedbeaf0852ba86a024b9932fd76bd89902eb062d29c3ac0793448c66ef0","fileSha256":"79106ac65424604a53ca79186ecc2bad7dbbdc92135f4d626b3d9b63cebb6e55","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-1-part-1/第1份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-1-part-1/第1份-TXT校验表.csv","reviewJsonPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-1-part-1/第1份-初筛进度备份.json"}},{"sta